WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.202
And compelling information from police.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.037
And a crucial witness

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.372
revealing new details

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.840
about the savage murders

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.908
of four university students.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:09.542
Yesterday,

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.711
we saw furniture from the crime scene

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:13.113
in Moscow, Idaho,

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.448
being loaded into trucks and taken away.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:16.483
CNN's Gary

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:17.917
Tuchman is on the scene

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.119
for us as investigators

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:19.986
try to work out

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:21.721
exactly what happened inside

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.922
that building

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.892
in the probable cause affidavit.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:26.593
A Moscow,

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.360
Idaho, police

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.262
corporal says after finding the victims

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.463
who were killed,

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.265
I noticed what appeared to be a tan

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.667
leather knife sheath laying on the bed.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.069
The Idaho State Lab later

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:37.837
located a single source of male

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.472
DNA left on the button

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.374
snap of the knife sheath.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.943
Police say the DNA is suspect Brian

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.978
Kielburger.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:45.879
This is the house

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.781
where the college students were killed.

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.082
According to the affidavit,

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.417
when police arrived.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.451
They went through that door

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.586
with the Christmas wreath is

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:54.587
on the second floor.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.556
To the right of the door is the bedroom.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.624
Rosanna Cano

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.059
and Ethan Chapman were killed

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.961
also on the second floor to the left

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.296
in the back of the house.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.731
According to the affidavit,

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.933
that's where the witness DNA was.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.402
And finally, on the third floor,

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.271
you see that window right there?

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.372
According to the affidavit,

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:13.907
that's where Caylee Gonsalves

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.542
and Madison Morgan were.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.976
And that's where the knife sheath

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.345
was found based on the affidavit.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:19.946
It appears

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:20.880
Brian Kielburger

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.915
has been near this house

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.783
many times before.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:24.451
The affidavit

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:25.585
indicating Coburg, her

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.420
cell phone signal was detected

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.321
12 times

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.355
near the house

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.924
over a period of five months

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.592
prior to the murders.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.761
All of these occasions, except for one,

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.062
occurred in the late evening

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.430
and early morning hours

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.099
of their respective days.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.433
It wouldn't necessarily

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.368
be suspicious of Brian Coburg

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:43.603
or drove past this house

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.805
12 times over five months.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.208
If these were busy or prominent streets

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:49.142
or streets

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.844
on the way to another neighborhood.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:51.644
But to come here

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.979
you have to be looking for

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:54.481
these roads are winding,

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.716
they're narrow, they're curvy.

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:57.383
In short,

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.184
it seems difficult

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.420
to accidentally end up here.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.387
The affidavit states

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.956
that one of the students who survived

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:03.656
with the initials

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.425
DM heard crying

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:07.527
and opened her door three times.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.496
She saw a figure clad in black clothing

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:10.830
and a mask that covered the person's

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.233
mouth and nose walking towards her.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.000
Diem described

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.069
the figure as five, ten or taller male,

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:17.270
not very muscular,

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.271
but athletically built

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.772
with bushy eyebrows.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.107
The male walked past him

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.109
as she stood in a frozen, shocked face.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:24.811
The male walked towards the back

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.279
sliding glass door.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.614
Dean locked herself in a room

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.015
after seeing the male

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:31.017
DM did not state that she recognize

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:31.851
the male.

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:32.719
This turned out

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:33.987
to be critical information

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:35.355
because in November 25th,

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:37.323
shortly after the murders, Moscow

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.526
police asked law enforcement agencies

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:40.293
to be on the lookout

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.028
for a white Hyundai Elantra

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.230
that had been seen near the murder site.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.632
Four days later, police

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:47.667
discovered a white Elantra

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.334
in this parking

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.836
lot just across the state line

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.538
in Pullman, Washington.

00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:53.139
According to the affidavit,

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:53.973
it was registered

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.108
a coworker

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:56.209
who lived up the stairs

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.178
in this townhouse complex

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.612
Police acquired his driver's

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.114
license information,

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:03.149
and they say, according to the affidavit,

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:04.117
that it was consistent

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:05.752
with the description of the man

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:08.054
she saw who was wearing black clothing

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:09.489
and a mask.

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:10.323
The affidavit does

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.325
not contain information about motive

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:13.426
or if the alleged killer knew

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:14.827
any of the victims,

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.229
but authorities could very well

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:17.864
have leads about those topics.

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:19.966
That are not being publicly released yet.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.035
Next Thursday,

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:22.669
in this courthouse

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:24.037
behind me, Brian Cobourg

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:25.071
will have another hearing.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:26.806
This will be a status hearing to discuss

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.741
scheduling in the case

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:29.943
within the next couple of weeks.

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.044
He will be arraigned

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:33.012
where he'll likely issue a plea.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:35.081
Let's bring in now Tracy Walter.

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:36.983
She is a former CIA officer

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:39.152
and a former FBI special agent.

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.286
Tracy, so the D.C. you.

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.955
So I want to ask you

00:03:41.955 --> 00:03:42.956
about all of the things

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:43.590
that we've been learning

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.224
about the suspect.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.892
But I do want to caution viewers

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:48.127
that there are some graphic details

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:50.129
that could come up in our conversation.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:53.032
So I do want you to be braced for that.

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:56.336
So, Tracy, what does it tell you

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:57.437
that the suspect

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.672
was allegedly around the house

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:02.475
multiple times before the killings?

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:04.877
Well, thank you so much

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:05.812
for having me, Fredricka.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.380
So what that does tell me

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.115
is that he was indeed

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.950
unfortunately stalking these victims,

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.352
because what's also important

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.886
is the absence

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.255
of cellular information

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:17.457
during that timeframe

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:18.825
of the killings that you mentioned.

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:21.027
So to have your cell phone

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.662
pinging around that area

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:24.764
when you don't live in that vicinity,

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:26.165
his vicinity in

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:28.134
WSU would have hit on a different

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:29.802
cell phone tower.

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:32.672
12 pings in the timeframe leading up

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:33.640
to the killings, in the months

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.875
leading up to the killings that signify

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.377
But what's also significant

00:04:37.377 --> 00:04:38.911
is that there was no cell phone

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:41.814
activity for 2 hours.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:43.116
Is it your suspicion

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:45.218
that there was some sort of interaction?

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:47.620
I mean, you are using the word stalking.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.255
There was some interest

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:53.326
that he allegedly had in these victims.

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:55.495
Do you feel

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.162
like there

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:58.464
it may have been precipitated by

00:04:58.464 --> 00:04:59.332
some interaction?

00:04:59.332 --> 00:04:59.499
I mean,

00:04:59.499 --> 00:05:00.800
how would you

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.469
examine the evidence to discern that?

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:06.806
So one of the best ways

00:05:06.806 --> 00:05:08.374
to get information to discern

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:10.610
that would actually be social media.

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:12.145
You know, had

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:13.546
he had any interactions

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:14.080
just in terms

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.648
of liking things

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:18.051
on their social media or vice versa.

00:05:18.051 --> 00:05:19.252
I do believe

00:05:19.252 --> 00:05:20.320
and I've always kind

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.988
of aspired to this theory

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.489
and agreed with this theory

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.725
that he came into contact,

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:28.294
but it was most likely brief.

00:05:28.294 --> 00:05:30.163
It may not have even piqued

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.165
the radar of the victims.

00:05:32.365 --> 00:05:33.166
And I believe

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:35.868
that's probably how he selected

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:38.805
one to all of them as his target.

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:39.672
So social media

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:41.074
would really come into play

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:42.909
there as well as witness

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:44.944
testimony of any interactions

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:46.412
And then investigators clearly

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:48.481
are probably still poring over

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:50.717
all the social media

00:05:50.717 --> 00:05:54.787
presence of any and all of of the victims

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:56.856
and I recall hearing from

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:57.490
from many

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.057
who have looked

00:05:58.057 --> 00:05:59.292
at a lot of the Instagram.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:01.127
There was a lot of information there.

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:03.096
There's a lot of activity

00:06:03.096 --> 00:06:05.431
that has been posted by these victims.

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:07.533
So police say coworker

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.569
he also cleaned his car

00:06:09.569 --> 00:06:10.370
very carefully

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.605
and also took care of disposing of trash

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.074
at his parents house. So

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:17.210
we know that he had been

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:18.544
studying criminology.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.213
What does all of this

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:23.082
tell you about his awareness

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:24.917
you know,

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:26.552
perhaps using information

00:06:26.552 --> 00:06:28.020
he has learned as a student,

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.690
I mean, preparing himself for

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:33.626
not just the crime, allegedly,

00:06:33.626 --> 00:06:36.863
but for afterwards.

00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:38.531
You know what's fascinating about that?

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:39.232
Rodriguez, I'm

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.633
actually an adjunct faculty

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:41.968
of criminal justice at Texas

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:43.236
Christian University.

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:44.804
And it's surprising to me

00:06:44.804 --> 00:06:47.039
how much he didn't learn it necessarily.

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:48.341
The reality is this

00:06:48.341 --> 00:06:49.575
We teach all students

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.511
trash becomes public property

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:52.545
once it's out there on the street.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:53.112
And so the fact

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.781
that he was trying to circumnavigate

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.883
that and place it into neighbors

00:06:56.883 --> 00:06:58.351
trash cans

00:06:58.351 --> 00:07:00.953
is a bit shocking to me, quite frankly.

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:02.622
And then also the fact that he was doing

00:07:02.622 --> 00:07:03.523
so in the reports

00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:07.493
I read on CNN at 4 a.m., you know, FBI,

00:07:07.527 --> 00:07:09.662
myself included, we were on surveillance

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:11.297
all hours of the day.

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:13.199
So he had to have known

00:07:13.199 --> 00:07:14.801
or suspected

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:16.636
that he would have been watched.

00:07:16.636 --> 00:07:18.404
Had he done something like that.

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:20.573
I do believe that he is arrogant

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.008
and has an ego

00:07:22.008 --> 00:07:22.475
big enough

00:07:22.475 --> 00:07:24.110
to think that he is smarter

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:24.977
than everyone else

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:27.246
and that he had outsmarted the system.

00:07:27.513 --> 00:07:29.916
Mm hmm. Yeah. And as you as you

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:32.051
really paint

00:07:32.051 --> 00:07:32.885
the picture on that

00:07:32.885 --> 00:07:33.853
it makes me rethink

00:07:33.853 --> 00:07:35.421
the whole cell phone pings.

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:36.489
Obviously, that is something

00:07:36.489 --> 00:07:37.690
that you would learn to

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.592
as a student of criminology,

00:07:39.592 --> 00:07:40.326
all of the things

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:42.929
that would be indicators

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:44.697
that eventually can be evidence

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:47.867
of your whereabouts and how.

00:07:47.867 --> 00:07:49.202
He probably should have known that,

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:50.203
but I guess didn't.

00:07:50.203 --> 00:07:52.472
So a roommate in the house

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:55.341
identified by the document as D.M.

00:07:55.808 --> 00:07:57.009
said a masked person

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.277
walked right past her

00:07:58.277 --> 00:07:59.612
as she opened up the door.

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:00.580
And, you know,

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.216
she recalls the the bushy eyebrows,

00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:05.885
but that he didn't harm her,

00:08:06.786 --> 00:08:08.187
but that it was described

00:08:08.187 --> 00:08:09.489
that she kind of froze.

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:11.591
I mean, what does that moment tell you?

00:08:11.591 --> 00:08:12.191
About

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:14.026
maybe is that the element of surprise

00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:16.162
or is there anything about familiarity

00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:20.433
or what do you dissect from that moment?

00:08:22.201 --> 00:08:23.569
So I just dissect a couple of

00:08:23.569 --> 00:08:24.604
things from that moment.

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:25.605
First of all,

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:27.173
a lot of people are being quite harsh

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:28.040
to that young lady,

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.009
and we don't know what we would do

00:08:30.009 --> 00:08:32.345
in a situation like that.

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:33.346
I truly

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:36.315
think that he probably didn't see her.

00:08:36.482 --> 00:08:38.117
I believe that she saw him.

00:08:38.117 --> 00:08:39.252
I looked at the floorplan

00:08:39.252 --> 00:08:40.152
of the house again

00:08:40.152 --> 00:08:41.687
just to kind of figure out

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:43.756
what that angle would have looked like.

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.625
I believe that after

00:08:45.625 --> 00:08:48.694
he most likely killed Zina and Ethan,

00:08:48.694 --> 00:08:51.063
he was just looking to get straight

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.265
out of that house.

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:54.133
And if she just had her or her door

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:55.768
just cracked a little bit,

00:08:55.768 --> 00:08:58.104
he very well may not have seen her.

00:08:58.104 --> 00:09:02.475
And I think that she completely froze at

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:03.109
that point.

00:09:03.109 --> 00:09:05.077
So in my opinion, that's

00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:05.912
what happened there.

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:06.445
But I do

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:08.281
